  "duration_s": 639.2,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "一个躺在行军帐篷里，发着高烧的老人，浑身烫的像块炭，连水都咽不下去了，身边的儿子和将领围了一圈，等着他交代后事。那个老人突然睁开眼，咬着牙从嘴里挤出一句话，让帐篷里所有人都僵住了。那个地方一个活口都不要留，房墙给我推了，房子给我烧了，连地都给我给我淹了。说这话的人，不是哪个占山为王的土匪，而是当时地球上最强大的征服者。成吉思汗铁木真，一个被无数人捧为一代天骄的草原帝王。他要灭的是一个在中亚大地上，繁华了上百年，控制着整条丝绸之路的富庶大国。花喇子模这个国家有坚固的城墙，有精美的清真四有藏书，丰富的经学院有自己的文字和货币都城，御龙劫赤的人口比当时欧洲任何一座城市都多可。就因为成吉思汗厌弃前的一句话，蒙古大军把玉龙劫持的城墙拆了，把清真寺烧了，把经书和档案堆在广场上，点了火，最后还掘开阿姆河的堤坝，把整座城市泡在了水里，一个靠丝路贸易，富甲一方的文明。就这么从地图上被硬生生抹掉了一个已经打下半个世界的老人。为什么非要在自己快不行的时候，咬着牙非要把一个中亚大国从根上刨了。您先别急着划走这一段被蒙古西征的宏大叙事盖的严严实实的故事，其实藏着成吉思汗一生中最愤怒，也最冷血的一次算计。老哥哥老姐姐，麻烦您指尖轻点一下，小红心算给我撑个场也方便。您想回看的时候，一翻就找着咱们泡壶茶慢慢往下聊。咱们把时间拨回到公元一千两百一十八年。那时候的成吉思汗刚刚统一蒙古草原，正想跟西边的花喇子模做做生意。过几天，安生日子，他派了一支四百多人的商队，带着金银和货物浩浩荡荡往花喇子模走。结果走到一个叫额达腊的边境城市，花喇子模的守将起了贪心，把商队的人全杀了，货物全抢了。成吉思汗听到这个消息，没有立刻发兵，他先派了三个使者去花辣子磨交涉，说咱们有话好好说，把凶手交出来就行。可花喇子魔的国王磨和墨干了什么？他把蒙古的政史杀了，把两个副使的胡子剃了赶了回去，剃胡子。在当时是对男人最大的侮辱。成吉思汗听到这个消息，一个人跑到山顶上摘下帽子，脸贴着地向长生天祈祷了三天三夜。然后他站起来说了一句话，只要我还有一口气，我就要让花喇子模付出代价。戴着这种极度的愤怒。成吉思汗亲率二十万，蒙古大军越过天山，杀进了花喇子摩。花喇子摩虽然富，但国王摩诃没根本不会打仗，他把军队分散在各个城里，想靠城墙硬扛。蒙古大军像蝗虫一样，一个城一个城地撵过去，撒马尔汗投降了，布哈拉，被屠了摩诃墨，一路往西逃，最后病死在里海的一个小岛上，可成吉思汗的怒火没有因为摩和墨的死而熄灭，他把目光转向了花喇子模的旧都玉龙洁赤。这座城太富了，城墙太厚了，里面的守军太顽固了，蒙古大军围了整整半年，死了好几个大将，硬是打不下来。成吉思汗这时候已经六十多岁了，常年征战把他的身体拖垮了。他在行军途中发起了高烧，躺在帐篷里听着前方传来的战报，他脑子里翻来覆去想的只有一件事儿，如果自己死了，玉龙劫翅还没打下来，花辣子魔人会不会又缓过劲来？蒙古大军撤了以后，这座城会不会又变成一根卡在喉咙里的刺？对于一个把帝国命运看得比命还重的征服者来说，答案只有一个，趁自己还能说话，把这座城盯死成吉思汗，把儿子窝阔台和察和台叫到床前，用沙哑的声音交代了最后的命令。玉龙劫赤不接受投降。城破之后，工匠全部挑出来送回蒙古，剩下的一个不留城里的金银财宝，不用急着搬，先把人杀干净再说。然后掘开阿姆河的堤坝放水，淹城让这座城从此以后再也住不了人。交代完这一切，成吉思汗在六盘山的军营里闭上了眼睛。蒙古大军严格执行了这个命令。公元一千两百两十一年四月，玉龙劫赤的守军在围了半年之后终于撑不住了，城里的粮食早就吃光了，连老鼠都被人抓来吃了。蒙古军攻破城墙后，把全城的老百姓驱赶到城外，工匠被一批一批挑出来数了数整整十万，全部押送回东方。剩下的壮丁被编进了蒙古军队，当炮灰，使其余的居民不管男女老少，全部被分配给了蒙古将士，任由处置史书上写的冰冷渔民进屠。接下来发生的事情超出了当时中亚人对战争的一切想象。蒙古士兵挨家挨户搜，只要是活着的，不管你是念经的学者，还是种地的农民。一刀下去，玉龙截翅的街道上，尸体堆的比城墙还高学，顺着排水沟流进了阿姆河，把河水都染红了。可杀人只是第一步，蒙古人把城里的清真寺推倒，把经学院里的藏书和手稿全部搬出来，堆在广场上，一把火烧了花。喇子魔人写的史书诗集、天文历法、医学典籍烧了整整几天几夜。花喇子模的文字写在羊皮和木片上的那种，从此以后再也没有人教，再也没有人写。然后蒙古士兵掘开了，阿姆河的堤坝，洪水像一头野兽一样冲进了玉龙皆持把，剩下的房屋、宫殿、寺庙全部泡在了水里，一座曾经比巴格达还繁华的城市变成了一片沼泽。玉龙劫翅被淹掉之后，蒙古人在旁边重新建了一座小城，但花蜡子模这个名字从此在中亚的历史上彻底消失了。没有人再提花剌子墨的文字。没有人再提玉荣劫持的经学院。没有人再提那条曾经养活了几十万人的丝路商道。此后几百年里，这片土地上来来往往的都是新的征服者，新的帝国花辣子馍就像从来没有存在过一样。直到近代，考古学家拿着铲子跑到土库曼斯坦的沙漠里，在库尼亚沃尔根旗的遗址底下，挖出了花喇子摩时代的钱币、陶器和刻着花喇子馍文字的残片。这个被大火和洪水从人类记忆里强行抠掉的文明才一点一点从土里被刨了出来。很多人读到这段历史，心里都会堵的慌。成吉思汗在蒙古草原上是一个神，他统一了部落，建立了帝国，打通了东西方的商路。可他在花喇子摩做的事情，让所有读过这段历史的人都后背发凉。他下的那道命令，说到底不是一时的暴怒，而是一种极其冷血的帝王，算计一个城，只要还有人住，只要还有人记得自己的文字和信仰，他就有可能重新站起来。所以最彻底的办法不是打赢，他是让他从地图上消失，从记忆里断掉。今日的千古迷局，咱就聊到这儿。可最要命的谜团，其实还埋在阿姆河的淤泥底下。当御龙劫持的工匠们被蒙古兵压着，往东走回头，看见自己的家乡正在被洪水吞没的时候，他们心里到底是恨蒙古人太狠，还是恨自己的国王，当初为什么要剃掉那三个使者的胡子？而成吉思汗在六盘山的帐篷里咽下最后一口气的时候，他到底觉得自己是在为蒙古帝国永绝后患，还是被一股连他自己都控制不住的怒火推着走完了最后一步。最后问您一句，抛开一代天骄的光环，您觉得成吉思汗下令水淹遇龙结翅屠灭花喇子模这件事，到底是一个帝国缔造者必须做的决断，还是一个被愤怒和权力同时吞掉的人对另一个文明犯下的不可原谅的罪行，评论区静待您的高见。如果您喜欢听这种藏在历史缝里的故事，别忘了点个关注，带您看透历史迷局。咱们下期视频见。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00001",
      "start_ms": 150,
      "end_ms": 2170,
      "text": "一个躺在行军帐篷里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00002",
      "start_ms": 2170,
      "end_ms": 3450,
      "text": "发着高烧的老人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00003",
      "start_ms": 3910,
      "end_ms": 5550,
      "text": "浑身烫的像块炭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00004",
      "start_ms": 6130,
      "end_ms": 7890,
      "text": "连水都咽不下去了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00005",
      "start_ms": 8670,
      "end_ms": 11310,
      "text": "身边的儿子和将领围了一圈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00006",
      "start_ms": 11650,
      "end_ms": 12990,
      "text": "等着他交代后事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00007",
      "start_ms": 13610,
      "end_ms": 15450,
      "text": "那个老人突然睁开眼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00008",
      "start_ms": 15970,
      "end_ms": 18130,
      "text": "咬着牙从嘴里挤出一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00009",
      "start_ms": 18490,
      "end_ms": 21310,
      "text": "让帐篷里所有人都僵住了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00010",
      "start_ms": 22030,
      "end_ms": 25270,
      "text": "那个地方一个活口都不要留，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00011",
      "start_ms": 26530,
      "end_ms": 27850,
      "text": "房墙给我推了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00012",
      "start_ms": 28130,
      "end_ms": 29330,
      "text": "房子给我烧了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00013",
      "start_ms": 29330,
      "end_ms": 30780,
      "text": "连地都给我给我淹了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00014",
      "start_ms": 31580,
      "end_ms": 32500,
      "text": "说这话的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00015",
      "start_ms": 33280,
      "end_ms": 35500,
      "text": "不是哪个占山为王的土匪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00016",
      "start_ms": 36060,
      "end_ms": 39680,
      "text": "而是当时地球上最强大的征服者。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00017",
      "start_ms": 39780,
      "end_ms": 41240,
      "text": "成吉思汗铁木真，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00018",
      "start_ms": 41680,
      "end_ms": 45540,
      "text": "一个被无数人捧为一代天骄的草原帝王。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00019",
      "start_ms": 46319,
      "end_ms": 49560,
      "text": "他要灭的是一个在中亚大地上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00020",
      "start_ms": 49600,
      "end_ms": 51000,
      "text": "繁华了上百年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00021",
      "start_ms": 51520,
      "end_ms": 54760,
      "text": "控制着整条丝绸之路的富庶大国。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00022",
      "start_ms": 54780,
      "end_ms": 58120,
      "text": "花喇子模这个国家有坚固的城墙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00023",
      "start_ms": 58580,
      "end_ms": 61480,
      "text": "有精美的清真四有藏书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00024",
      "start_ms": 61580,
      "end_ms": 65890,
      "text": "丰富的经学院有自己的文字和货币都城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00025",
      "start_ms": 65910,
      "end_ms": 70510,
      "text": "御龙劫赤的人口比当时欧洲任何一座城市都多可。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00026",
      "start_ms": 70510,
      "end_ms": 73370,
      "text": "就因为成吉思汗厌弃前的一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00027",
      "start_ms": 73450,
      "end_ms": 76450,
      "text": "蒙古大军把玉龙劫持的城墙拆了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00028",
      "start_ms": 76570,
      "end_ms": 77825,
      "text": "把清真寺烧了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00029",
      "start_ms": 78200,
      "end_ms": 80300,
      "text": "把经书和档案堆在广场上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00030",
      "start_ms": 80300,
      "end_ms": 80855,
      "text": "点了火，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00031",
      "start_ms": 81400,
      "end_ms": 83755,
      "text": "最后还掘开阿姆河的堤坝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00032",
      "start_ms": 84120,
      "end_ms": 86685,
      "text": "把整座城市泡在了水里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00033",
      "start_ms": 87490,
      "end_ms": 89050,
      "text": "一个靠丝路贸易，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00034",
      "start_ms": 89090,
      "end_ms": 90625,
      "text": "富甲一方的文明。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00035",
      "start_ms": 91060,
      "end_ms": 97475,
      "text": "就这么从地图上被硬生生抹掉了一个已经打下半个世界的老人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00036",
      "start_ms": 98070,
      "end_ms": 100415,
      "text": "为什么非要在自己快不行的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00037",
      "start_ms": 100890,
      "end_ms": 104395,
      "text": "咬着牙非要把一个中亚大国从根上刨了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00038",
      "start_ms": 105100,
      "end_ms": 112730,
      "text": "您先别急着划走这一段被蒙古西征的宏大叙事盖的严严实实的故事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00039",
      "start_ms": 112810,
      "end_ms": 116615,
      "text": "其实藏着成吉思汗一生中最愤怒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00040",
      "start_ms": 116890,
      "end_ms": 118755,
      "text": "也最冷血的一次算计。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00041",
      "start_ms": 119270,
      "end_ms": 120295,
      "text": "老哥哥老姐姐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00042",
      "start_ms": 120620,
      "end_ms": 122460,
      "text": "麻烦您指尖轻点一下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00043",
      "start_ms": 122460,
      "end_ms": 126040,
      "text": "小红心算给我撑个场也方便。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00044",
      "start_ms": 126040,
      "end_ms": 127480,
      "text": "您想回看的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00045",
      "start_ms": 127500,
      "end_ms": 131565,
      "text": "一翻就找着咱们泡壶茶慢慢往下聊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00046",
      "start_ms": 132370,
      "end_ms": 136415,
      "text": "咱们把时间拨回到公元一千两百一十八年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00047",
      "start_ms": 137310,
      "end_ms": 140705,
      "text": "那时候的成吉思汗刚刚统一蒙古草原，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00048",
      "start_ms": 141270,
      "end_ms": 144365,
      "text": "正想跟西边的花喇子模做做生意。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00049",
      "start_ms": 144960,
      "end_ms": 145500,
      "text": "过几天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00050",
      "start_ms": 145500,
      "end_ms": 146185,
      "text": "安生日子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00051",
      "start_ms": 146680,
      "end_ms": 149020,
      "text": "他派了一支四百多人的商队，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00052",
      "start_ms": 149060,
      "end_ms": 152895,
      "text": "带着金银和货物浩浩荡荡往花喇子模走。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00053",
      "start_ms": 153520,
      "end_ms": 156775,
      "text": "结果走到一个叫额达腊的边境城市，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00054",
      "start_ms": 157240,
      "end_ms": 159385,
      "text": "花喇子模的守将起了贪心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00055",
      "start_ms": 159850,
      "end_ms": 161605,
      "text": "把商队的人全杀了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00056",
      "start_ms": 162180,
      "end_ms": 163335,
      "text": "货物全抢了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00057",
      "start_ms": 163800,
      "end_ms": 165615,
      "text": "成吉思汗听到这个消息，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00058",
      "start_ms": 165960,
      "end_ms": 167155,
      "text": "没有立刻发兵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00059",
      "start_ms": 167590,
      "end_ms": 171575,
      "text": "他先派了三个使者去花辣子磨交涉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00060",
      "start_ms": 172140,
      "end_ms": 173875,
      "text": "说咱们有话好好说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00061",
      "start_ms": 174210,
      "end_ms": 175585,
      "text": "把凶手交出来就行。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00062",
      "start_ms": 176330,
      "end_ms": 179075,
      "text": "可花喇子魔的国王磨和墨干了什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00063",
      "start_ms": 179830,
      "end_ms": 181570,
      "text": "他把蒙古的政史杀了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00064",
      "start_ms": 181630,
      "end_ms": 184270,
      "text": "把两个副使的胡子剃了赶了回去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00065",
      "start_ms": 184750,
      "end_ms": 185370,
      "text": "剃胡子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00066",
      "start_ms": 185370,
      "end_ms": 187669,
      "text": "在当时是对男人最大的侮辱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00067",
      "start_ms": 188290,
      "end_ms": 190370,
      "text": "成吉思汗听到这个消息，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00068",
      "start_ms": 190670,
      "end_ms": 193530,
      "text": "一个人跑到山顶上摘下帽子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00069",
      "start_ms": 193790,
      "end_ms": 198090,
      "text": "脸贴着地向长生天祈祷了三天三夜。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00070",
      "start_ms": 198530,
      "end_ms": 201150,
      "text": "然后他站起来说了一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00071",
      "start_ms": 202050,
      "end_ms": 203530,
      "text": "只要我还有一口气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00072",
      "start_ms": 203990,
      "end_ms": 206350,
      "text": "我就要让花喇子模付出代价。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00073",
      "start_ms": 207190,
      "end_ms": 209050,
      "text": "戴着这种极度的愤怒。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00074",
      "start_ms": 209700,
      "end_ms": 211920,
      "text": "成吉思汗亲率二十万，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00075",
      "start_ms": 211920,
      "end_ms": 213920,
      "text": "蒙古大军越过天山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00076",
      "start_ms": 214280,
      "end_ms": 215900,
      "text": "杀进了花喇子摩。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00077",
      "start_ms": 216780,
      "end_ms": 218160,
      "text": "花喇子摩虽然富，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00078",
      "start_ms": 218520,
      "end_ms": 221460,
      "text": "但国王摩诃没根本不会打仗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00079",
      "start_ms": 221460,
      "end_ms": 223840,
      "text": "他把军队分散在各个城里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00080",
      "start_ms": 224140,
      "end_ms": 225940,
      "text": "想靠城墙硬扛。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00081",
      "start_ms": 226560,
      "end_ms": 228620,
      "text": "蒙古大军像蝗虫一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00082",
      "start_ms": 228720,
      "end_ms": 230900,
      "text": "一个城一个城地撵过去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00083",
      "start_ms": 231840,
      "end_ms": 233115,
      "text": "撒马尔汗投降了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00084",
      "start_ms": 234960,
      "end_ms": 235380,
      "text": "布哈拉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00085",
      "start_ms": 235380,
      "end_ms": 236860,
      "text": "被屠了摩诃墨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00086",
      "start_ms": 236880,
      "end_ms": 238000,
      "text": "一路往西逃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00087",
      "start_ms": 238400,
      "end_ms": 241405,
      "text": "最后病死在里海的一个小岛上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00088",
      "start_ms": 242220,
      "end_ms": 247055,
      "text": "可成吉思汗的怒火没有因为摩和墨的死而熄灭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00089",
      "start_ms": 247760,
      "end_ms": 252235,
      "text": "他把目光转向了花喇子模的旧都玉龙洁赤。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00090",
      "start_ms": 252920,
      "end_ms": 254475,
      "text": "这座城太富了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00091",
      "start_ms": 254730,
      "end_ms": 256105,
      "text": "城墙太厚了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00092",
      "start_ms": 256590,
      "end_ms": 258605,
      "text": "里面的守军太顽固了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00093",
      "start_ms": 259420,
      "end_ms": 262130,
      "text": "蒙古大军围了整整半年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00094",
      "start_ms": 262390,
      "end_ms": 263555,
      "text": "死了好几个大将，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00095",
      "start_ms": 263820,
      "end_ms": 264915,
      "text": "硬是打不下来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00096",
      "start_ms": 265340,
      "end_ms": 267485,
      "text": "成吉思汗这时候已经六十多岁了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00097",
      "start_ms": 267850,
      "end_ms": 270205,
      "text": "常年征战把他的身体拖垮了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00098",
      "start_ms": 270610,
      "end_ms": 272755,
      "text": "他在行军途中发起了高烧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00099",
      "start_ms": 273400,
      "end_ms": 276275,
      "text": "躺在帐篷里听着前方传来的战报，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00100",
      "start_ms": 276890,
      "end_ms": 279660,
      "text": "他脑子里翻来覆去想的只有一件事儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00101",
      "start_ms": 280040,
      "end_ms": 281255,
      "text": "如果自己死了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00102",
      "start_ms": 281530,
      "end_ms": 283155,
      "text": "玉龙劫翅还没打下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00103",
      "start_ms": 283570,
      "end_ms": 285775,
      "text": "花辣子魔人会不会又缓过劲来？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00104",
      "start_ms": 286430,
      "end_ms": 287915,
      "text": "蒙古大军撤了以后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00105",
      "start_ms": 288270,
      "end_ms": 291865,
      "text": "这座城会不会又变成一根卡在喉咙里的刺？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00106",
      "start_ms": 292510,
      "end_ms": 297190,
      "text": "对于一个把帝国命运看得比命还重的征服者来说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00107",
      "start_ms": 297270,
      "end_ms": 298270,
      "text": "答案只有一个，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00108",
      "start_ms": 298410,
      "end_ms": 299690,
      "text": "趁自己还能说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00109",
      "start_ms": 300050,
      "end_ms": 303070,
      "text": "把这座城盯死成吉思汗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00110",
      "start_ms": 303070,
      "end_ms": 306390,
      "text": "把儿子窝阔台和察和台叫到床前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00111",
      "start_ms": 306810,
      "end_ms": 309870,
      "text": "用沙哑的声音交代了最后的命令。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00112",
      "start_ms": 310390,
      "end_ms": 313390,
      "text": "玉龙劫赤不接受投降。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00113",
      "start_ms": 313690,
      "end_ms": 314590,
      "text": "城破之后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00114",
      "start_ms": 314850,
      "end_ms": 317470,
      "text": "工匠全部挑出来送回蒙古，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00115",
      "start_ms": 318210,
      "end_ms": 322960,
      "text": "剩下的一个不留城里的金银财宝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00116",
      "start_ms": 323740,
      "end_ms": 324700,
      "text": "不用急着搬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00117",
      "start_ms": 325500,
      "end_ms": 327040,
      "text": "先把人杀干净再说。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00118",
      "start_ms": 327480,
      "end_ms": 330740,
      "text": "然后掘开阿姆河的堤坝放水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00119",
      "start_ms": 330840,
      "end_ms": 335300,
      "text": "淹城让这座城从此以后再也住不了人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00120",
      "start_ms": 335440,
      "end_ms": 336560,
      "text": "交代完这一切，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00121",
      "start_ms": 336880,
      "end_ms": 340380,
      "text": "成吉思汗在六盘山的军营里闭上了眼睛。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00122",
      "start_ms": 340980,
      "end_ms": 343680,
      "text": "蒙古大军严格执行了这个命令。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00123",
      "start_ms": 344100,
      "end_ms": 346420,
      "text": "公元一千两百两十一年四月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00124",
      "start_ms": 346900,
      "end_ms": 350645,
      "text": "玉龙劫赤的守军在围了半年之后终于撑不住了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00125",
      "start_ms": 351680,
      "end_ms": 353605,
      "text": "城里的粮食早就吃光了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00126",
      "start_ms": 353960,
      "end_ms": 355785,
      "text": "连老鼠都被人抓来吃了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00127",
      "start_ms": 356460,
      "end_ms": 358025,
      "text": "蒙古军攻破城墙后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00128",
      "start_ms": 358550,
      "end_ms": 360855,
      "text": "把全城的老百姓驱赶到城外，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00129",
      "start_ms": 361630,
      "end_ms": 366195,
      "text": "工匠被一批一批挑出来数了数整整十万，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00130",
      "start_ms": 367020,
      "end_ms": 368985,
      "text": "全部押送回东方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00131",
      "start_ms": 369680,
      "end_ms": 372770,
      "text": "剩下的壮丁被编进了蒙古军队，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00132",
      "start_ms": 372830,
      "end_ms": 373410,
      "text": "当炮灰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00133",
      "start_ms": 373410,
      "end_ms": 376695,
      "text": "使其余的居民不管男女老少，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00134",
      "start_ms": 377180,
      "end_ms": 380165,
      "text": "全部被分配给了蒙古将士，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00135",
      "start_ms": 380560,
      "end_ms": 384695,
      "text": "任由处置史书上写的冰冷渔民进屠。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00136",
      "start_ms": 385650,
      "end_ms": 390665,
      "text": "接下来发生的事情超出了当时中亚人对战争的一切想象。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00137",
      "start_ms": 391500,
      "end_ms": 393235,
      "text": "蒙古士兵挨家挨户搜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00138",
      "start_ms": 393980,
      "end_ms": 394985,
      "text": "只要是活着的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00139",
      "start_ms": 395320,
      "end_ms": 396985,
      "text": "不管你是念经的学者，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00140",
      "start_ms": 397320,
      "end_ms": 398795,
      "text": "还是种地的农民。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00141",
      "start_ms": 399100,
      "end_ms": 399885,
      "text": "一刀下去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00142",
      "start_ms": 400310,
      "end_ms": 401905,
      "text": "玉龙截翅的街道上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00143",
      "start_ms": 402310,
      "end_ms": 405395,
      "text": "尸体堆的比城墙还高学，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00144",
      "start_ms": 405830,
      "end_ms": 408375,
      "text": "顺着排水沟流进了阿姆河，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00145",
      "start_ms": 409270,
      "end_ms": 410770,
      "text": "把河水都染红了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00146",
      "start_ms": 410830,
      "end_ms": 412175,
      "text": "可杀人只是第一步，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00147",
      "start_ms": 412780,
      "end_ms": 415125,
      "text": "蒙古人把城里的清真寺推倒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00148",
      "start_ms": 415380,
      "end_ms": 418860,
      "text": "把经学院里的藏书和手稿全部搬出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00149",
      "start_ms": 418960,
      "end_ms": 420065,
      "text": "堆在广场上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00150",
      "start_ms": 420320,
      "end_ms": 422340,
      "text": "一把火烧了花。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00151",
      "start_ms": 422340,
      "end_ms": 429845,
      "text": "喇子魔人写的史书诗集、天文历法、医学典籍烧了整整几天几夜。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00152",
      "start_ms": 430760,
      "end_ms": 434735,
      "text": "花喇子模的文字写在羊皮和木片上的那种，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00153",
      "start_ms": 435470,
      "end_ms": 437225,
      "text": "从此以后再也没有人教，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00154",
      "start_ms": 437920,
      "end_ms": 439005,
      "text": "再也没有人写。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00155",
      "start_ms": 439750,
      "end_ms": 442300,
      "text": "然后蒙古士兵掘开了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00156",
      "start_ms": 442300,
      "end_ms": 443465,
      "text": "阿姆河的堤坝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00157",
      "start_ms": 444180,
      "end_ms": 448910,
      "text": "洪水像一头野兽一样冲进了玉龙皆持把，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00158",
      "start_ms": 448910,
      "end_ms": 453515,
      "text": "剩下的房屋、宫殿、寺庙全部泡在了水里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00159",
      "start_ms": 454310,
      "end_ms": 459265,
      "text": "一座曾经比巴格达还繁华的城市变成了一片沼泽。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00160",
      "start_ms": 460110,
      "end_ms": 461955,
      "text": "玉龙劫翅被淹掉之后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00161",
      "start_ms": 462410,
      "end_ms": 465415,
      "text": "蒙古人在旁边重新建了一座小城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00162",
      "start_ms": 466050,
      "end_ms": 471215,
      "text": "但花蜡子模这个名字从此在中亚的历史上彻底消失了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00163",
      "start_ms": 472020,
      "end_ms": 473995,
      "text": "没有人再提花剌子墨的文字。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00164",
      "start_ms": 474520,
      "end_ms": 477435,
      "text": "没有人再提玉荣劫持的经学院。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00165",
      "start_ms": 477950,
      "end_ms": 482555,
      "text": "没有人再提那条曾经养活了几十万人的丝路商道。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00166",
      "start_ms": 483230,
      "end_ms": 485080,
      "text": "此后几百年里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00167",
      "start_ms": 485140,
      "end_ms": 488165,
      "text": "这片土地上来来往往的都是新的征服者，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00168",
      "start_ms": 488480,
      "end_ms": 492875,
      "text": "新的帝国花辣子馍就像从来没有存在过一样。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00169",
      "start_ms": 493400,
      "end_ms": 494315,
      "text": "直到近代，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00170",
      "start_ms": 494670,
      "end_ms": 498435,
      "text": "考古学家拿着铲子跑到土库曼斯坦的沙漠里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00171",
      "start_ms": 498980,
      "end_ms": 501380,
      "text": "在库尼亚沃尔根旗的遗址底下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00172",
      "start_ms": 501420,
      "end_ms": 507865,
      "text": "挖出了花喇子摩时代的钱币、陶器和刻着花喇子馍文字的残片。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00173",
      "start_ms": 508660,
      "end_ms": 517565,
      "text": "这个被大火和洪水从人类记忆里强行抠掉的文明才一点一点从土里被刨了出来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00174",
      "start_ms": 518540,
      "end_ms": 520020,
      "text": "很多人读到这段历史，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00175",
      "start_ms": 520140,
      "end_ms": 521405,
      "text": "心里都会堵的慌。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00176",
      "start_ms": 522410,
      "end_ms": 525065,
      "text": "成吉思汗在蒙古草原上是一个神，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00177",
      "start_ms": 525840,
      "end_ms": 527065,
      "text": "他统一了部落，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00178",
      "start_ms": 527390,
      "end_ms": 528445,
      "text": "建立了帝国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00179",
      "start_ms": 528990,
      "end_ms": 530795,
      "text": "打通了东西方的商路。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00180",
      "start_ms": 531710,
      "end_ms": 533745,
      "text": "可他在花喇子摩做的事情，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00181",
      "start_ms": 534390,
      "end_ms": 537855,
      "text": "让所有读过这段历史的人都后背发凉。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00182",
      "start_ms": 538520,
      "end_ms": 539895,
      "text": "他下的那道命令，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00183",
      "start_ms": 540270,
      "end_ms": 542445,
      "text": "说到底不是一时的暴怒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00184",
      "start_ms": 542860,
      "end_ms": 545140,
      "text": "而是一种极其冷血的帝王，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00185",
      "start_ms": 545160,
      "end_ms": 546900,
      "text": "算计一个城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00186",
      "start_ms": 546920,
      "end_ms": 548025,
      "text": "只要还有人住，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00187",
      "start_ms": 548560,
      "end_ms": 551125,
      "text": "只要还有人记得自己的文字和信仰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00188",
      "start_ms": 551460,
      "end_ms": 553565,
      "text": "他就有可能重新站起来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00189",
      "start_ms": 554000,
      "end_ms": 556420,
      "text": "所以最彻底的办法不是打赢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00190",
      "start_ms": 556480,
      "end_ms": 559505,
      "text": "他是让他从地图上消失，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00191",
      "start_ms": 559940,
      "end_ms": 561605,
      "text": "从记忆里断掉。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00192",
      "start_ms": 562340,
      "end_ms": 563960,
      "text": "今日的千古迷局，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00193",
      "start_ms": 564060,
      "end_ms": 565115,
      "text": "咱就聊到这儿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00194",
      "start_ms": 565330,
      "end_ms": 566710,
      "text": "可最要命的谜团，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00195",
      "start_ms": 567050,
      "end_ms": 569755,
      "text": "其实还埋在阿姆河的淤泥底下。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00196",
      "start_ms": 570390,
      "end_ms": 573410,
      "text": "当御龙劫持的工匠们被蒙古兵压着，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00197",
      "start_ms": 573410,
      "end_ms": 575070,
      "text": "往东走回头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00198",
      "start_ms": 575070,
      "end_ms": 578705,
      "text": "看见自己的家乡正在被洪水吞没的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00199",
      "start_ms": 579170,
      "end_ms": 581895,
      "text": "他们心里到底是恨蒙古人太狠，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00200",
      "start_ms": 582640,
      "end_ms": 584060,
      "text": "还是恨自己的国王，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00201",
      "start_ms": 584080,
      "end_ms": 587615,
      "text": "当初为什么要剃掉那三个使者的胡子？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00202",
      "start_ms": 588350,
      "end_ms": 593570,
      "text": "而成吉思汗在六盘山的帐篷里咽下最后一口气的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00203",
      "start_ms": 593570,
      "end_ms": 597695,
      "text": "他到底觉得自己是在为蒙古帝国永绝后患，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00204",
      "start_ms": 598080,
      "end_ms": 603225,
      "text": "还是被一股连他自己都控制不住的怒火推着走完了最后一步。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00205",
      "start_ms": 603740,
      "end_ms": 604635,
      "text": "最后问您一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00206",
      "start_ms": 605090,
      "end_ms": 607195,
      "text": "抛开一代天骄的光环，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00207",
      "start_ms": 607730,
      "end_ms": 614215,
      "text": "您觉得成吉思汗下令水淹遇龙结翅屠灭花喇子模这件事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00208",
      "start_ms": 614600,
      "end_ms": 618435,
      "text": "到底是一个帝国缔造者必须做的决断，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00209",
      "start_ms": 618970,
      "end_ms": 626265,
      "text": "还是一个被愤怒和权力同时吞掉的人对另一个文明犯下的不可原谅的罪行，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00210",
      "start_ms": 627190,
      "end_ms": 629545,
      "text": "评论区静待您的高见。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00211",
      "start_ms": 629840,
      "end_ms": 633115,
      "text": "如果您喜欢听这种藏在历史缝里的故事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00212",
      "start_ms": 633570,
      "end_ms": 634815,
      "text": "别忘了点个关注，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00213",
      "start_ms": 635250,
      "end_ms": 637125,
      "text": "带您看透历史迷局。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1fe724ccf0f613f_s00214",
      "start_ms": 637840,
      "end_ms": 639065,
      "text": "咱们下期视频见。"
    }
  ],
